    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Soon after Muranishi buys the shop, two uniformed patrol officers walk down a Sapporo street looking for lunch. Instead of a quiet neighborhood block, they spot Kitamori managing a long line outside Hokudai Kanda Bookstore—and identical storefronts opening down the road. Hear the scene in Japanese first, and don't worry about catching every word.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "ああ、腹が減ったな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "定食ですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "なんであんなに繁盛してるんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "北大神田書店？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "お待たせしてすみません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "順番になります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "あっ、新作が出ました！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "千五百円になります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "どうぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "先輩、ちょっと！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "あそこも北大神田書店ができてます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "何なんですかね？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Notice the contrast between the patrol officers chatting casually about lunch and Kitamori's crisp shop-counter Japanese. Let's look closer.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "ああ、腹が減ったな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Man, I am hungry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "定食ですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are we getting a set meal?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "なんであんなに繁盛してるんだ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why is that place doing such booming business?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "お待たせしてすみません。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sorry to keep you waiting.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "順番になります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We will serve you in order.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "あっ、新作が出ました！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, a new release just came out!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kitamori",
      "t": "千五百円になります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That comes to one thousand five hundred yen.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "先輩、ちょっと！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Senior officer, look here!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "あそこも北大神田書店ができてます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Another Hokudai Kanda Bookstore has opened over there too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "何なんですかね？",
      "gap": 0.55
